  "limitations": [
    "Approval concerns the feature criteria, not clean security, product GUI acceptance, a sandbox, redistribution rights or an accepted risk.",
    "Deny still reports 165 license diagnostics and 12 duplicate families; OSV/RustSec maintenance advisories remain enabled. No blanket suppression or dependency upgrade.",
    "Geiger attempted all 16 members but two reports remain incomplete and the aggregate returns error; coverage and SBOM have no invented threshold.",
    "Runtime binaries, datasets and full source/build snapshots remain private. Portable observed identity records are integrity/provenance evidence, not authentication of external services.",
    "All original observations and failures remain historical; current selective successors are explicit in the resumption report.",
    "2026-11-07: Trivy/OSV/Grype data preparation/execution moved to toolbox. No Docker execution in Ox-only task; predecessor local-data execution is historical."
